---
// 404 页面
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="404 - 页面不存在" description="你访问的页面不存在。">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-24 text-center sm:px-6">
    <pre
      class="mx-auto inline-block select-none text-left font-mono text-xs leading-tight text-brand-500/70 sm:text-sm"
      aria-hidden="true">
┌─────────────────────────────┐
│  $ tt2 status --name this   │
│  ✗ 404: site not found      │
└─────────────────────────────┘</pre>
    <h1 class="mt-8 text-4xl font-bold text-brand-50">404 · 页面不存在</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-zinc-400">这个地址没有部署任何站点，可能是链接已失效或输入有误。</p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
      <a href="/" class="rounded-lg bg-brand-500 px-5 py-2.5 font-medium text-ink-950 transition-colors hover:bg-brand-400">
        回到首页
      </a>
      <a href="/docs/" class="rounded-lg border border-ink-500 px-5 py-2.5 font-medium text-zinc-300 transition-colors hover:border-brand-500/60 hover:text-brand-300">
        查看文档
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
